<title>PAKISTAN: PAKISTAN ASKARI BANK FIRST HALF NET UP.</title>
<headline>PAKISTAN ASKARI BANK FIRST HALF NET UP.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30, 1997 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     370 vs 264</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit    155 vs 114</p>
<p>    Interim dividend   nil vs nil per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Askari Commercial Bank Ltd. The bank said it carried forward 156 million vs 116 million to the balance sheet. There is no book closure as the bank has not announced any dividend.</p>
<p>($1=40.62 rupees)</p>
<p>-- Karachi Newsroom (9221) 5685192; Fax (9221) 5673428</p>
